OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to charges
OL,4,Alinked to Simon Coveney bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to charges
OL,7,Frelating to a loyalist bomb hoax
OL,8,Ftargeting the former Irish foreign
OL,9,Faffairs minister Simon Coveney.
OL,11,FDarren James Service, 45, of
OL,12,FBallysillan Road in north Belfast,
OL,13,Fappeared at Belfast Crown Court on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FHis trial was due to begin on 7
OL,17,FSeptember. Senior defence counsel
OL,18,FJoseph O'Keefe KC told Judge Gordon
OL,19,FKerr KC that he had an application for
OL,20,FService to be re-arraigned on two of
OL,21,Fthe three charges he faced which he had
OL,22,Fpreviously denied.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
