OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to charges
OL,4,Alinked to Simon Coveney bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FService entered guilty pleas to
OL,7,Fhijacking a Vauxhall Vivaro van and
OL,8,Fplacing an article causing a bomb hoax
OL,9,Fat the Houben Centre, Holy Cross Church
OL,10,Fon the Crumlin Road on 25 March 2022.
